<wxs module="media" src="../../../wxs/media.wxs"/>
<view class="cms-card"><view class="cms-section-title">品牌与实用信息</view><text class="cms-meta">选填信息留空时不展示。坐标须同时填写；宣传片使用已配置小程序媒体域名的 HTTPS 链接。</text><view wx:for="{{fields}}" wx:key="key" class="cms-field"><text class="cms-label">{{item.label}}</text><textarea wx:if="{{item.multiline}}" class="cms-input cms-textarea" value="{{form[item.key]}}" bindinput="field" data-key="{{item.key}}" maxlength="{{item.max}}" auto-height/><input wx:else class="cms-input" value="{{form[item.key]}}" bindinput="field" data-key="{{item.key}}" maxlength="{{item.max}}"/></view></view>
<view wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="key" wx:for-item="group" class="cms-card"><view class="cms-section-title">{{group.title}}</view><text class="cms-meta">图片对应上方展示图片的顺序；可选不配图。调整图片后，请核对关联图片。</text><view wx:for="{{cards[group.key]}}" wx:key="index" class="scenic-editor-card"><text class="cms-label">内容 {{index+1}}</text><input class="cms-input" value="{{item.title}}" data-group="{{group.key}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-key="title" bindinput="card" maxlength="80" placeholder="标题（必填）"/><textarea class="cms-input cms-textarea" value="{{item.desc}}" data-group="{{group.key}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-key="desc" bindinput="card" maxlength="2000" auto-height placeholder="内容介绍"/><picker range="{{photoChoices}}" value="{{item.imageIndex}}" data-group="{{group.key}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-key="imageIndex" bindchange="card"><view class="cms-input">{{photoChoices[item.imageIndex]||'请选择图片'}} <text class="icon-unfold"/></view></picker><image wx:if="{{images[item.imageIndex-1]}}" class="scenic-editor-photo" src="{{media.display(images[item.imageIndex-1],mediaUrls)}}" mode="aspectFill"/><button class="cms-button cms-danger" bindtap="remove" data-group="{{group.key}}" data-index="{{index}}">删除此项</button></view><button class="cms-button cms-secondary" bindtap="add" data-group="{{group.key}}">＋ 添加{{group.title}}</button></view>
